    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-haupaix-avian-plumage-somite-stripes-repro-package> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
        rdfs:label "Haupaix et al. (2018), Inaba et al. (2019) & Lin et al. (2013) somite-prepatterned Agouti signaling, melanocyte gap-junction reaction-diffusion and feather-follicle ring-niche chevrons in galliform plumage stripes — Reproducibility package: 90/100" ;
        dcterms:date "2026-10-20"^^xsd:date ;
        dcterms:description "Deterministic seed 2018, 12-check `--self-test` (L1312-L1405, ~4 s) covering the four SHA-256 locks, Lean Laws 1-5 as integer/monotonicity instances, PDE, species, chimeras, dose axis, controls, specimen CV, bitwise two-run determinism, lattice row counts, mutants and chevron geometry; the PNG regenerates byte-identically across runs (80cf4ed6...) and the default render takes ~7 s. Deductions: no requirements lock file is vendored for this slot (-4); matplotlib needs MPLCONFIGDIR when the home cache is unwritable and the README does not say so (-2); the GIF is unchanged from Pass 2 and does not show the follicle coupling (-2); `--species` is a dead flag (-2)." ;
        dcterms:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-repro-package> ;
